Subject: Preserve collection text roundtrips for empty and generic values

Emit the typed JSON envelope for both key types, retaining known value types
when empty. Accept bare {} as an untyped empty and preserve it in storage.
Use the PostgreSQL input API with typioparam and typmod -1 for all values,
including SQL NULL so domain constraints are enforced. Underlying per-value
typmods are not part of the collection representation. No SQL or ABI change.

